.idea/

# Generated data / logs - all runtime output lives in Strategies/Default/data/.
# Most of it is regenerable (backtest caches, screener/sell reports, logs,
# near-misses, API caches) and stays ignored, but a few files are the ONLY
# copy of real data with no other source of truth - the Stats tab's
# leaderboard, the personal Holdings/Sell tab's positions, and the whole
# Fund Manager ledger (investors, capital events, NAV history, fund
# holdings, cash, NAV generation marker) - so those are explicitly kept.
Strategies/Default/data/*
!Strategies/Default/data/strategy_stats.csv
!Strategies/Default/data/holdings.csv
!Strategies/Default/data/fund
Strategies/universe_cache.json
